links hlist navbar-mini"><ul><li class="nv-view"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template:Metric_units_of_length" title="Template:Metric units of length"><abbr title="View this template">v</abbr></a></li><li class="nv-talk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Metric_units_of_length" title="Template talk:Metric units of length"><abbr title="Discuss this template">t</abbr></a></li><li class="nv-edit"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:EditPage/Template:Metric_units_of_length" title="Special:EditPage/Template:Metric units of length"><abbr title="Edit this template">e</abbr></a></li></ul></div><div id="Metric_units_of_length_(by_order_of_magnitude)3923" style="font-size:114%;margin:0 4em"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metric_system" title="Metric system">Metric</a> units of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Length" title="Length">length</a> (by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orders_of_magnitude_(length)" title="Orders of magnitude (length)">order of magnitude</a>)</div></th></tr><tr><td class="navbox-abovebelow" colspan="2"><div>From smallest to largest (left to right). Commonly used units shown in <i><b>bold italics</b></i>.</div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="navbox-list navbox-odd hlist" style="width:100%;padding:0"><div style="padding:0 0.25em">
<ul><li><span class="nowrap"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quectometre" title="Quectometre" class="mw-redirect">quectometre<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size: 85%;">(qm=10<sup><span typeof="mw:Entity">−</span>30</sup><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>m)</span></a></span></li>
<li><span class="nowrap"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rontometre" title="Rontometre" class="mw-redirect">rontometre<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size: 85%;">(rm=10<sup><span typeof="mw:Entity">−</span>27</sup><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>m)</span></a></span></li>
<li><span class="nowrap"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yoctometre" title="Yoctometre" class="mw-redirect">yoctometre<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size: 85%;">(ym=10<sup><span typeof="mw:Entity">−</span>24</sup><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>m)</span></a></span></li>
<li><span class="nowrap"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zeptometre" title="Zeptometre" class="mw-redirect">zeptometre<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size: 85%;">(zm=10<sup><span typeof="mw:Entity">−</span>21</sup><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>m)</span></a></span></li>
